{"id":"n41669-3-7","stage":5,"title":"눌리다 · 被压制","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41669-3-7-1","ko":"환자분은 분노를 많이 억제하고 계시는 것 같습니다.","zh":"看来这位患者正在极力压抑自己的愤怒。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"환자분은","meaning":"患者，病人；愤慨，怨忿","explanation":"환자：患者，病人；분：愤慨，怨忿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"환자","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3"},{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31669","senseId":"1","lemma":"환자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"59407","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환자분은","audio":"/audio/62801d06844ddc17585d.mp3"}},{"text":"분노를","meaning":"愤怒","explanation":"분노：愤怒；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"분노","audio":"/audio/5a90f06f273092fc4e70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26792","senseId":"1","lemma":"분노","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분노를","audio":"/audio/2c78421ad593d967837c.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"억제하고","meaning":"抑制","explanation":"억제하다：抑制；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"억제하다","audio":"/audio/3f33c51ffa44e84d1adc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67196","senseId":"1","lemma":"억제하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"억제하고","audio":"/audio/cdcd30af15b5ae191d3f.mp3"}},{"text":"계시는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）","explanation":"계시다：正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61346","senseId":"1","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계시는","audio":"/audio/c9e167f481f7cbbae224.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같습니다","audio":"/audio/70b461d79f2fe5361c43.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7780fb9b6e0ea5fd","term":"환자","zh":"患者，病人","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3","entryId":"31669","definition":"由于身体生病或受伤而疼痛的人。","pronunciation":["환ː자"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"愤慨，怨忿","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"59407","definition":"十分生气或委屈的情绪。","pronunciation":["분ː"]},{"id":"5a90f06f273092fc","term":"분노","zh":"愤怒","audio":"/audio/5a90f06f273092fc4e70.mp3","entryId":"26792","definition":"十分生气的情绪。","pronunciation":["분ː노"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"3f33c51ffa44e84d","term":"억제하다","zh":"抑制","audio":"/audio/3f33c51ffa44e84d1adc.mp3","entryId":"67196","definition":"使感情、欲望或冲动的行为等平息下去或不产生。","pronunciation":["억쩨하다"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"61346","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 계시다，尊敬表达）","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a8fa3fdc6e8c1f391d0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41669-3-7-2","ko":"맞아요. 사실 제 속에는 눌린 분노가 많아요.","zh":"没错。其实我内心也积压了太多的怒火。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}},{"text":"사실","meaning":"事实上，其实","explanation":"사실：事实上，其实","readings":[{"term":"사실","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71275","senseId":"2","lemma":"사실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사실","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"속에는","meaning":"心思，心眼","explanation":"속：心思，心眼；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"5","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속에는","audio":"/audio/a3fac9e650c6d9f68d7c.mp3"}},{"text":"눌린","meaning":"被压制，被抑制","explanation":"눌리다：被压制，被抑制；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"눌리다","audio":"/audio/19cb9285003c89c3b1b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41669","senseId":"3","lemma":"눌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눌린","audio":"/audio/cf49c755bee90cdfda04.mp3"}},{"text":"분노가","meaning":"愤怒","explanation":"분노：愤怒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분노","audio":"/audio/5a90f06f273092fc4e70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26792","senseId":"1","lemma":"분노","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분노가","audio":"/audio/57cc2279a73c965c77da.mp3"}},{"text":"많아요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아요","audio":"/audio/e2d2cc074c8e28c555ca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"c087c91deb495f97","term":"사실","zh":"事实上，其实","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3","entryId":"71275","definition":"用于直率地说出表面上看不出的事实。","pronunciation":["사ː실"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"心思，心眼","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"怀有的心或想法。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"19cb9285003c89c3","term":"눌리다","zh":"被压制，被抑制","audio":"/audio/19cb9285003c89c3b1b0.mp3","entryId":"41669","definition":"使感情或想法不显露出来。","pronunciation":["눌ː리다"]},{"id":"5a90f06f273092fc","term":"분노","zh":"愤怒","audio":"/audio/5a90f06f273092fc4e70.mp3","entryId":"26792","definition":"十分生气的情绪。","pronunciation":["분ː노"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f05c80b6a7c650c770c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.571,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41669","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3977,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没错。其实我内心也积压了太多的怒火。","盛夏时，太阳散发出的阳光实在热得让人难以忍受。","看来这位患者正在极力压抑自己的愤怒。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没错。其实我内心也积压了太多的怒火。","看来这位患者正在极力压抑自己的愤怒。","盛夏时，太阳散发出的阳光实在热得让人难以忍受。"],"answer":0}]}
